Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:24.04,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Gosh, it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:26.87,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yeah, summer's in full swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:28.86,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,By the way, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:31.36,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,There's a lot to do in the summer, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:33.13,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Is there anything you'd \Nlike to do as a couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:35.68,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What a great idea, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:39.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's see... what would be best?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.89,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Barbecues, fireworks displays...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:46.19,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A trip to the mountains would be nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:47.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,but I think it {\i1}has{\i0} to be the beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:48.73,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The beach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.28,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:56.15,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Swimsuits?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:58.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey! Fudo?
