Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:55.32,main,Beast,0,0,0,,You let me down, big-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.92,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Don't you know you've got \Nan image to maintain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:02.12,main,Beast,0,0,0,,You were the one person around here \Nwith a ferocity I could respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.97,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Now look at you, eating pasta with \Nthat goofy look on your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:09.71,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Why'd you want to join \NGekko in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.85,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I didn't. My family applied for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:13.83,main,Beast,0,0,0,,What are you, an idol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:17.96,main,Beast,0,0,0,,But that entrance exam ain't easy. \NHow the hell'd you pass, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:23.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I just did my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.53,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,and they put me in a leadership role.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:31.06,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She never meant to apply? Is that \Nwhy she doesn't take it seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:33.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:36.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't you think a beach would be \Na great place for our next attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.97,0:03:37.65,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:44.41,italicstop,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,All squad leaders and Princess Series members,\Nreport to the conference room at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:45.80,italicstop,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,I repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:47.62,main,Beast,0,0,0,,They don't usually call \Nus in at this time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:49.87,italicstop,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,All squad leaders and Princess Series members,\N report to the conference room at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:55.63,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:59.19,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Drop the pasta and get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.89,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Beast Princess and Reaper Princess,\N now in attendance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:11.89,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4\an8}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:11.89,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:16.99,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Secret Society Gekko is an \Nuncompromising hierarchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(320,33,320,43)}Supreme Leader Bosslar
