Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(285,143,290,143)\blur1\t(6076,6117,\3c&H9CFFFC&)}Wolf Monster
