Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(285,220,290,212)\blur1\t(10830,10872,\3c&H9995F1&)}Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(365,220,360,212)\blur1\t(11331,11373,\3c&H9995F1&)}Heat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(440,220,430,212)\blur1\t(11831,11873,\3c&H9995F1&)}Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(518,220,498,212)\blur1\t(12332,12374,\3c&H9995F1&)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:24.92,sign_6040_68_Supreme_Leader_B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(328,275,328,263)\fs15\fsp2.5\t(1,13030,\fs13)}Moonlight Soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:21.33,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Its six squadrons are led by \Ntheir six strongest monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:24.92,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,with the Princess Series serving \Nbelow them as sub-leaders!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.89,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Allow me to reveal the reason \NI have called you all here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:35.79,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I have decided to create a new monster \Nand establish a new squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:41.07,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess, step forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.93,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:51.05,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess, Desumi Magahara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:52.88,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I am promoting you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:57.44,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,from Princess Series to monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:00.18,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You'll undergo enhancement surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:01.84,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,be fused with an animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:04.19,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,and acquire greater power than ever before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:06.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You... You want to make me a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:08.95,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Damn it! They passed me over for {\i1}her{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:10.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hang on a min—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.34,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,You're moving up in the world at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.62,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I always knew you had it in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:18.08,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Welcome to the monster world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.46,main,Matchlock,0,0,0,,These bodies are awesome, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:24.48,main,Beast,0,0,0,,It's frustrating, but I'm gonna catch up soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:26.83,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Just wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:28.68,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Reaper-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:31.33,main,Drone,0,0,0,,You'll be just like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.18,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Drone Rabbit-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.84,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,She's so pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:38.79,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,If I could become a cute monster \Nlike her, maybe it wouldn't be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.52,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:46.07,sign_8187_110_Fusion_Concept_D,Sign,0,0,0,,Fusion {\3c&H528892&}Con{\3c&H3A4977&}cept {\3c&H7E405A&}Dia{\3c&H7DAABC&}gram
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:45.00,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I intend to fuse you with a mountain gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:49.19,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,A fusion between the two ultimate primates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:52.33,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,A true miracle of chemistry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:53.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.70,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,The enhancement surgery \Nwill take place tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.15,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.15,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:58.11,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:05.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,If I become a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,it'll mean big changes to life as I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:11.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No beach date, either, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:16.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But I can't exactly say no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:25.78,sign_9132_124_Lifetime_Soldier,Sign,0,0,0,,Lifetime Soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:23.16,italics,Desumi's Father,0,0,0,,Hey, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.55,italics,Desumi's Father,0,0,0,,How ya doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:25.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:29.20,italics,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Got a message from Bosslar-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.62,italics,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,He's promotin' you, he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:34.49,italics,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,That's my perfect little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.25,italics,Desumi's little brother,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.62,italics,Desumi's family,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:43.41,italics,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Never thought we'd have a monster in our \Nvery own family... It's a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:45.99,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Now, dear, don't cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.63,italics,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I was a combatant all through to retirement,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:49.63,italics,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,so it's makin' me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:52.45,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Give it your best, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:53.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:55.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,The truth is... I'm not sure I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:58.59,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,And after seeing' how hard you been workin',
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:01.29,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,your sister's finally started \Ncomin' out of her shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:02.82,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Go on, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.02,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Talk to your big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.03,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.14,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:11.44,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join Gekko when I graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:14.66,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,You better keep fightin', \Neven after you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:17.66,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,You're my idol, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:21.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I hear ya, Urami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:23.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.66,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,See ya, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.81,italics,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:30.11,italics,Siblings,0,0,0,,See ya! Keep fightin', Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:40.77,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,My Gekko teammates and my family \Nare all so happy for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:45.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,They'll all be really upset if I \Nturn the promotion down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:53.33,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I wonder what Fudo would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.48,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.79,sign_11462_157_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:07:59.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,F-Fudo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:02.41,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wh-Whaddya want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.41,0:08:04.55,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,That adorable Hakata dialect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:09.60,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about you, \Nand I realized I wanted to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:12.11,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Is something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:13.55,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your greeting was a little \Nbit different than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.04,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your greeting was a little \Nbit different than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:20.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm sure I heard wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.75,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.86,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Give me one hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:39.70,sign_12413_166_I_m_here__Desumi,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(352,200)\fax0.02\frz21.41}I'm here, Desumi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:45.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:57.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:59.62,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,They want to make you a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:02.16,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, and combine me with a gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:04.48,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You'd be the world's cutest gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This is serious for me, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:12.19,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:13.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.76,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.97,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you{\i0} want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:22.64,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,What {\i0}I{\i1} want to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.71,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.97,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I never even thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:32.23,sign_13667_180_Gekko_Interview_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(305,40,305,54)\fsp3\fad(1,368)\t(1,2230,\fs17)}Gekko Interview Site
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:33.95,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:39.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your kindness toward everyone around you \Nis one of the things I love best about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:44.89,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But you should turn a little bit of that \Nkindness toward yourself every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:49.29,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Now, what do {\i1}you{\i0} want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:54.01,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:57.18,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,It is okay for me to choose, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.66,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,If I become a gorilla,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:04.21,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,it's going to be harder to do my manicures, \Nmy cooking, my handicrafts...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It would make it harder \Nto see you, too, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:11.92,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I want to go back to the \Namusement park with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.81,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I want to have our afterschool date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:16.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't feel comfortable going \Nto the beach in any body but this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up on any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.20,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:27.81,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Meeting you has made me want \Nto do so many new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:30.56,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,If I was still the person I was before you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.52,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I probably would have gone along with \Nwhat everyone else wanted for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.78,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:38.97,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:41.75,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I can't become a gorilla yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:48.37,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I want to be able to keep \Nleaning on Fudo like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:54.24,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:57.30,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,What do you mean, you don't \Nwant to become a monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:00.86,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.80,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Are you freakin' nuts, Reaper?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:05.14,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,This is your chance to acquire {\i1}true{\i0} power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:09.66,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You reject your great leader's generous offer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:10.27,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.21,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:23.62,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You are truly a wonder, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.12,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:28.31,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Your style is to fight only with \Nyour naturally-given gifts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:31.37,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Truly, you have the heart of a martial artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:36.13,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You believe accepting the power of an animal \Nwould be admitting your own weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.38,sign_16692_216_Burned,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(450,20)}Burned
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.24,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,All right! A round of applause \Nfor Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:43.34,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You all could learn a thing or two from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:48.18,sign_16960_219_I_told_them_I_di,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(225,265)\fsp.1\fad(1,98)}I told them I didn't want to become a monster{\c&H3423F3&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:53.52,sign_16960_219_I_told_them_I_di,,0,0,0,,{\pos(65,43)\fs15\fsp6}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.98,sign_16960_219_I_told_them_I_di,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(303,250)\fad(89,104)}Thanks, Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:53.52,sign_16960_219_I_told_them_I_di,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(185,195)\fad(113,1)}You followed your heart\N and turned them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:53.52,sign_16960_219_I_told_them_I_di,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(185,300)\fad(113,1)}You're amazing, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:57.05,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:59.27,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,She must have gotten her enhancement surgery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:03.06,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,So that's what she looks like after \Nbeing combined with the gorilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:05.74,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Yeah! She's more intimidating than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:10.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:24.84,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wow, the weather is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:28.85,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm all ready! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.12,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,One moment, Reaper Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:34.10,sign_18009_232_Ack,Sign,0,0,0,,Ack
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:34.52,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that beach stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.22,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Just because we're at the beach \Ndoesn't mean it's a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.48,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.55,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Now, are you sure about \Nthat tip you received?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:43.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Absolutely certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:47.24,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,You mean it, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:48.11,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:48.51,flashbacktop,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:54.25,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,This Saturday, we'll be doing a test drive \Nof King Gelato Robo at Shonan Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:50.48,flashbacktop,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:53.24,flashbacktop,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:54.25,flashbacktop,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.48,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:13:03.50,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,King Gelato Robo is a 12-piece combining\N robot designed to fight giant monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.75,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,The beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:06.89,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:07.85,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:09.89,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's our chance for a beach date at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:12.64,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's great, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:15.02,sign_18970_254_Sparkle,Sign,0,0,0,,Sparkle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:15.43,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,I can't wait for Saturday!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:22.15,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hello? Is this Bear-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:25.03,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,I've just gotten a secret \Ntip about the heroes' activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.49,0:13:29.49,sign_19313_258_Gekko_Aquatic_Co,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(340,11,340,111)}Gekko Aquatic Combat Loadout\N{\fs13}Reaper Princess\N{\fs8}(Swimsuit Provided)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.49,0:13:29.49,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But it appears the heroes \Nhave not yet arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.50,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Then you should make careful \Npreparations for their arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:38.36,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,{\bord3\shad3}Our mission is to investigate \Nand demolish the heroes' robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:38.52,sign_19313_258_Gekko_Aquatic_Co,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(483,261)\fad(1,1037)}Gekko Aquatic Combat Loadout\N{\fs13} Culverin Bear & Steel Princess\N{\fs8}(Swimsuits Provided)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:41.17,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,{\bord3\shad3}It's important to act \Ncarefully and discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:44.23,main,Steel,0,0,0,,This is a combined mission \Nbetween our three squadrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:47.54,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Let's all work together, \NReaper-san, Beast-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.43,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Oh? Why are you hiding behind those rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:55.52,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I a-ain't hidin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.18,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:13:59.73,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:05.74,sign_20134_270_Majima,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,340)}Majima
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.00,top,Beast,0,0,0,,Don't my outfit seem a little \Ndifferent from what you guys got?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:05.74,sign_19313_258_Gekko_Aquatic_Co,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(130,243)\fs9}Gekko Aquatic Combat Loadout\N{\fs14}Beast Princess\N{\fs9}(Swimsuit Provided)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.12,top,Steel,0,0,0,,Certainly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:05.75,top,Steel,0,0,0,,It looks wonderful on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:06.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.51,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.12,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey, Steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.08,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Don't stand next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:13.87,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:16.50,main,Steel,0,0,0,,But why? We should work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.00,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Just get lost, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:43.48,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:46.81,main,Professor,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:49.14,main,Professor,0,0,0,,I accidentally fired the missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:51.49,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,They didn't hit anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:53.28,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I don't... think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:54.74,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.46,main,Beast,0,0,0,,They anticipated our sabotage mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.56,main,Beast,0,0,0,,A submarine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:02.96,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Is that a part of their giant robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.96,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's so much nicer out here than in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:11.99,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Misaki-san, no beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.01,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Oh, chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.89,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,As long as we're at the beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:15.94,main,Haru,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.79,main,Haru,0,0,0,,We're not here to have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:18.86,main,Professor,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.02,main,Professor,0,0,0,,None of that, Misaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:24.09,main,Professor,0,0,0,,That one's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:27.23,sign_22115_299_Ta_dah,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(85,20)}Ta-dah
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:26.26,main,Professor,0,0,0,,You'll want to drink these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.23,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:29.21,main,Professor,0,0,0,,Now, now, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:30.49,main,Professor,0,0,0,,I know we're doing a test drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:33.99,main,Professor,0,0,0,,but it's just for Gelato Submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:37.53,main,Professor,0,0,0,,And this one just forms the robot's calf,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.45,main,Professor,0,0,0,,so it's not exactly essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:41.52,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,Then why did you make it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.50,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Red's coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.19,main,Beast,0,0,0,,What's the plan, Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:54.14,main,Beast,0,0,0,,You think we can handle \Nthe mission on our own?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:55.68,main,Beast,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:15:59.91,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Found you, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:02.73,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh, Desumi-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:14.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:18.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I was so taken aback by your \Nloveliness that I forgot to breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:19.91,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Cut it out! You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:25.08,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:28.77,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I didn't choose the outfit myself, \Nbut it's a little embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:30.17,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(570,180)}Oh so precious
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:30.17,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh so precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:40.25,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Now, let's have the beach date of our dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.65,0:16:45.04,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That reminds me...\NThere was something I wanted to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.56,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:50.49,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She intends to execute the \Nplan completely on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:52.89,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess is truly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:55.82,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I always get \Nstuck evaluating risk...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.66,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,That's the difference between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:03.54,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,But... that ends today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.26,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,I, Beast Princess, A.K.A. Kiki Majima,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.19,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,will finally gain some respect—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:20.43,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She's torturing him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:20.43,sign_24901_335_She_s,sign,0,0,0,,She's {\alphaFF\t(633,634,\alpha00)}torturing him!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:21.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:23.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Can't move now, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:24.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:27.78,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess... She truly is merciless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And there's one other thing \NI really wanted to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:32.19,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,Sh-She's not finished yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:34.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,All ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:41.70,sign_25372_343_Menace,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(560,125,590,180)}Menace
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.00,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She's gonna smash his head open!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:46.00,sign_24901_335_She_s,sign,0,0,0,,She's {\alphaFF\t(505,506,\alpha00)}gonna smash his head open!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:51.59,sign_24901_335_She_s,sign,0,0,0,,She {\alphaFF\t(253,254,\alpha00)}sma{\alphaFF\t(503,504,\alpha00)}shed {\alphaFF\t(753,754,\alpha00)}it!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:51.59,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She smashed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.84,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Hey, cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:57.64,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.60,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Truly, is this not destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.84,main,Beast,0,0,0,,H-Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.43,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I know you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.32,main,Beast,0,0,0,,You're Blue Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:06.68,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Wow! You know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:08.21,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,That's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:11.32,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Come enjoy your summer with a celebrity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:14.25,main,Beast,0,0,0,,You're every bit the pig I'd heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:15.71,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.46,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Where's Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:20.34,main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:21.03,top,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:21.95,main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:24.70,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She's deeply infiltrated their ranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:24.70,sign_24901_335_She_s,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}She's deeply infiltrated {\alphaFF\t(1006,1007,\alpha00)}their ranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:25.83,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:27.89,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Just admit you want a piece of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:32.58,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Come back, my sweet honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:31.57,top,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.57,top,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:41.09,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I gotta say...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:45.22,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Desumi-chan, you said you were \NFudo's friend or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.23,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But it looks to {\i1}me{\i0} like you're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.23,sign_26979_373_grin,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz11.31\pos(360,240)\t(403,404,\alphaFF)\t(778,779,\alpha00)\t(1154,1155,\alphaFF)\t(1529,1530,\alpha00)\t(1905,1906,\alphaFF)}grin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.23,sign_26979_373_grin,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,227)\frz352.2\alphaFF\t(403,404,\alpha00)\t(778,779,\alphaFF)\t(1154,1155,\alpha00)\t(1529,1530,\alphaFF)\t(1905,1906,\alpha00)}grin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-Are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:49.98,sign_27088_375_shake,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz32.74\pos(297,70)}shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:50.19,sign_27088_375_shake,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz30.96\pos(480,95)\fs15}shake
