Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:52.69,sign_27088_375_shake,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz30.96\fs15\pos(545,95)}shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:53.94,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,So dang cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:52.90,sign_27088_375_shake,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz32.74\pos(365,70)}shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:53.11,sign_27088_375_shake,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz30.96\fs15\pos(545,95)}shake
