Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:18:53.94,sign_27088_375_shake,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz30.96\fs15\pos(545,95)}shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:58.15,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,I made chilled noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:00.04,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That's our boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.24,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.09,0:19:03.14,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:05.37,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:15.31,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:16.09,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:20.84,main,Professor,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:39.93,main,Haru,0,0,0,,They're so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:41.49,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well done, Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.87,main,Professor,0,0,0,,So much smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:49.62,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,So you're the one I have to thank?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Thank?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:57.05,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Fudo's become a better man than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:59.63,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,And he's sharing more sides of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:02.95,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I think that's because of you, Desumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:10.16,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Are you watching, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:11.89,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:14.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, it is, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.90,sign_29201_397_Handheld__200_Sp,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(130,20)}Hand{\c&HF2FEFF&\3c&H3540E3&}held \N{\c&H1500B0&\3c&HE6E5D2&\fs30}200 Sparklers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:19.90,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Look what we bought!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.66,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Let's all do them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:22.40,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.86,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:30.60,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:33.33,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,You really are an amazing man...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:36.81,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Since I first started going out with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:39.77,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,it's been nothing but \Nwonderful things every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:47.20,main,Professor,0,0,0,,I hope the young people \Nare enjoying themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:50.18,main,Professor,0,0,0,,Now, time to fire the final show-stopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.31,sign_29992_408_clunk,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(90,115)\fad(298,1)}clunk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:58.03,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Finally lost him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:59.77,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Talk about persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:02.30,main,Reaper,0,0,0,,Hey, Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.49,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.41,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,After all she did to Red, \Nit's like nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:09.14,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,But of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.06,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,not even she could destroy the whole robot—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:16.92,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She freaking did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:16.50,sign_24901_335_She_s,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}She {\alphaFF\t(675,676,\alpha00)}freaking did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That last firework was a really big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:22.51,italics,Beast,0,0,0,,She really knows no bounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:26.42,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What a wonderful day it's been!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.13,0:23:16.36,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:31.84,main,All,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:33.34,top,Beast,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.11,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(39,301)\fad(1005,1)\fscx90}Episode 7    {\fscx100\fsp4.8}Desumi Magahara Is the Monster I Made
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:37.43,top,Beast,0,0,0,,Episode 7 is gonna be \N"Desumi Magahara Is the Monster I Made."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.43,0:23:39.48,top,Beast,0,0,0,,So watch it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
